(7461347, 1183029, 86447, '<td valign="top">SUCH a PERFECT image for the challenge topic.<br/> <br/> <br/>Seems just a tad bit... "too perfect" though... so that throws me off a bit.<br/> <br/>The convenient side parking for the perfect old truck... the precision mowing of the hill...<br/> <br/>I wish it weren''t so "perfect"... and I... cringe when I say that.<br/> <br/>*sigh*<br/> <br/>Yet still... it''s one of my favorites of the gallery.<br/> <br/> <br/>It''s totally lovely.</td>', 'SUCH a PERFECT image for the challenge topic.  Seems just a tad bit... "too perfect" though... so that throws me off a bit. The convenient side parking for the perfect old truck... the precision mowing of the hill... I wish it weren''t so "perfect"... and I... cringe when I say that. *sigh* Yet still... it''s one of my favorites of the gallery.  It''s totally lovely.', '2016-06-22 22:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
