(7461376, 1183029, 114285, '<td valign="top">Sigh, I LOVE THIS, as soon as I saw it! This is so cookie cut PERFECT for the challenge. A real delight to look at, almost too good to be true! I adore the classic white fence, the rolling hills, the trees, the lawn mowed in straight lines, and who can not mention the classic red vintage car, which pops and gives contrast...where did that come from, would love to know, is it yours??<br/> <br/>If this doesn''t win, I''ll protest for you :-)</td>', 'Sigh, I LOVE THIS, as soon as I saw it! This is so cookie cut PERFECT for the challenge. A real delight to look at, almost too good to be true! I adore the classic white fence, the rolling hills, the trees, the lawn mowed in straight lines, and who can not mention the classic red vintage car, which pops and gives contrast...where did that come from, would love to know, is it yours?? If this doesn''t win, I''ll protest for you :-)', '2016-06-23 04:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
