(7461988, 1183098, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MichaelC:</b></div><hr/><i> Funny that Anita thought it was Deb or me, it is exactly the sort of shot we would have stopped to take. BTW we were there last year and it is just beautiful but we enjoyed Maggiore more. Congrats on the HM. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ha that is too funny!</td>', 'Originally posted by MichaelC: Funny that Anita thought it was Deb or me, it is exactly the sort of shot we would have stopped to take. BTW we were there last year and it is just beautiful but we enjoyed Maggiore more. Congrats on the HM.   Ha that is too funny!', '2016-06-28 11:45:22.000000', NULL, 0),
